$ dmm --config <config> --cache <cache> --storage <storage> source list
o ID  NAME  ENABLED  AUTH  SEARCH  NEEDS KEY  HAS KEY
o github  GitHub Releases  no  no  yes  no  no
o local  Local folders  yes  no  yes  no  no
o nexus  Nexus Mods  no  no  yes  yes  no
! exit 0
